---
import MarketingLayout from '../layouts/MarketingLayout.astro';

const SCHEDULING_LINK = "https://calendar.app.google/ZgCjgA8Mk3tosTmh9";
---

<MarketingLayout
	title="Work With Us — People/Purpose/Product"
	description="Schedule a conversation. We start by listening, not pitching."
>
	<section class="page-header">
		<h1>Let's talk about<br />what you're building.</h1>
		<p class="subhead">
			The first conversation isn't a pitch. It's a diagnostic. Here's what to expect.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="content-section">
		<h2>How it works</h2>
		<p>
			We run every first conversation the same way. Four things happen, in order:
		</p>
		<ol class="steps">
			<li>
				<span class="step-label">Pain</span>
				<span class="step-body">You describe what's not working, what you're trying to change, or what you can't build with what you have today. We listen and ask questions. No interruptions to pitch solutions.</span>
			</li>
			<li>
				<span class="step-label">Impact</span>
				<span class="step-body">We get specific about what solving this problem would mean — for your programs, your team, and the people you serve. What does success actually look like?</span>
			</li>
			<li>
				<span class="step-label">Value confirmed</span>
				<span class="step-body">We check: is this worth solving now? Some problems are real but not urgent. Some are urgent but not well-defined. We'd rather tell you that than take your money for the wrong project.</span>
			</li>
			<li>
				<span class="step-label">Solution</span>
				<span class="step-body">If there's a fit, we sketch what an engagement might look like — scope, approach, rough timeline. This is the start of a proposal, not a close.</span>
			</li>
		</ol>
	</section>

	<section class="content-section">
		<h2>What to expect</h2>
		<ul class="expectations">
			<li>30 minutes. No prep required on your end.</li>
			<li>No hard sell. If we're not the right fit, we'll say so.</li>
			<li>You'll leave with clarity on whether this is worth pursuing — regardless of whether we work together.</li>
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section class="content-section schedule-section">
		<h2>Schedule a conversation</h2>
		<p>Pick a time that works for you.</p>
		<a href={SCHEDULING_LINK} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cta-button">
			Find a time →
		</a>
		<p class="schedule-note">
			Prefer email? Reach out on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/nicknorena/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a> and we'll find a time.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="footer-nav">
		<p>Not ready yet? <a href="/blog">Read the blog</a> or <a href="/ai">learn how we think about AI</a>.</p>
	</section>
</MarketingLayout>

<style>
	.page-header {
		padding: 3em 0 2.5em;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(var(--gray-light));
		margin-bottom: 3em;
	}
	.page-header h1 {
		font-size: 3rem;
		line-height: 1.1;
		margin-bottom: 0.4em;
	}
	.subhead {
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		max-width: 600px;
	}

	.content-section {
		margin-bottom: 3em;
		padding-bottom: 3em;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(var(--gray-light));
		max-width: 720px;
	}
	.content-section h2 {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.75em;
	}

	/* Steps */
	.steps {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0;
		counter-reset: steps;
	}
	.steps li {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 160px 1fr;
		gap: 1em;
		padding: 1.25em 0;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(var(--gray-light));
		counter-increment: steps;
	}
	.steps li:last-child {
		border-bottom: none;
	}
	.step-label {
		font-weight: 700;
		color: rgb(var(--black));
		padding-top: 0.1em;
	}
	.step-body {
		color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	/* Expectations */
	.expectations {
		padding-left: 1.25em;
		margin: 0;
	}
	.expectations li {
		margin-bottom: 0.5em;
		color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
	}

	/* Schedule */
	.schedule-section {
		border-bottom: none;
	}
	.schedule-note {
		margin-top: 1em;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
	}

	.cta-button {
		display: inline-block;
		background: var(--accent);
		color: white;
		padding: 0.85em 2em;
		border-radius: 4px;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		transition: background 0.2s ease;
	}
	.cta-button:hover {
		background: var(--accent-dark);
		color: white;
	}

	.footer-nav {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		padding-top: 1em;
	}
	.footer-nav a {
		color: var(--accent);
		text-decoration: none;
	}
	.footer-nav a:hover {
		text-decoration: underline;
	}

	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		.page-header h1 {
			font-size: 2.25rem;
		}
		.steps li {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 0.25em;
		}
	}
</style>
